!Sample_data_processing = Basecalls performed using  Solexa pipeline v1.8
!Sample_data_processing = The trimmed reads (trimmed 5’,3’-adaptor bases using cutadapt) were aligned to reference genome using Hisat2 (2.0.5)software
!Sample_data_processing = The transcript abundances for each sample was estimated with StringTie（1.3.1c）
!Sample_data_processing = the FPKM value for gene and transcript level were calculated with R package Ballgown (v2.6.0)
!Sample_data_processing = The circRNA reads were aligned to reference genome using STAR(2.5.2b)detecting backesplicec junction reads with CIRCexplore2 (2.2.6)
